WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.000
Right after rescuing
a weird cargo ship,

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.650
we also saved
Rasara and Sarasa.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.590
As you'd expect, the cargo ship
had mobile suits hidden aboard.

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:45.660
We crushed them, thanks to
some wild feats on Mondo's part,

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.200
but as I think about it,
the two from Moon Moon...

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:51.410
seem to be acting as a
barrier between Haman and me.

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:54.500
I don't know if
Haman's still nearby.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:01.380
TIGERBAUM DREAM

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:33.330
Why is the port entrance mined?

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.420
Right! Dodge the
one to the right!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.360
Keithron!

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.580
- He says it's on the right.
- Shut up and watch.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:48.030
They sent out guidance lights,
and then...! Agh! There! There!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:48.970
Shut up!

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.540
No good!
You won't make it!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.740
Lower the defense shutters!

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.290
It... It's gonna hit us!

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.630
Shoot the mine!
Do it now!

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.170
Was that the last one?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.820
I thought this
was neutral airspace.

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:15.060
Did you think it was going to
be that easy when there's a war on?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:17.040
Point taken.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.750
Fancy colony.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:42.050
They say it's modeled on Hong Kong
and Kyoto from the Old Century.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.460
Wh-What the hell...?!

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.960
Open the line.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:46.700
Open your bridge!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:50.490
You don't know Tigerbaum's
immigration regs, do you?

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:53.430
Immigration regulations?

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:55.460
I speak for Stampa Halloi!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.540
The Nahel Argama's crew and
its civilians are to all disembark!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.560
- What are you doing?!
- Get back!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.140
What are you doing?!

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:06.630
Mobile suits cannot be operated!
No weapons can be fired, either!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:08.210
Are you kidding?!

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:11.680
If we hadn't shot that mine,
it would have blown up our bridge!

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.490
Move!

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.760
Hey! You're not sticking
one of those on me, too!

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:18.820
Here's a list of our
immigration regulations.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.230
Strict, aren't you?

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.510
Under no circumstances will you
remove the seals from your weapons!

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.970
Lady Haman!

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.970
Don't worry. It's a good chance
to see how the lower classes live.

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:33.620
Hey! If you've completed inspection,
then disembark at once!

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:48.320
A Gundam? That'll make me rich!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.860
Oh... the poor Nahel Argama!

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.160
They've lashed it down with wires?

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.660
If a battle broke
out during your stay,

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.030
Tigerbaum would lose its value.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.060
We won't do that!

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.190
Do you understand?
Commissioner Stampa Halloi...

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:09.140
is always working to ensure this
colony is forever untouched by war.

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:10.380
Stampu?

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.610
His Excellency Stampa Halloi!

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.470
As you can see, the entire
colony of Tigerbaum...

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:18.620
is maintained as
a sightseeing marvel.

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:21.790
It's all the work of
His Excellency Stampa Halloi.

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:23.760
He's the boss of this
amusement park, huh?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:24.860
What?!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:27.360
Amusement parks are
a symbol of peace, right?

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.710
Oh. I see.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:34.630
Get aboard.

00:05:34.630 --> 00:05:35.530
Where are we going?

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.050
Get aboard!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.670
Even a neutral colony can't
order us around without a reason!

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:41.170
I told you the reasons before!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.340
Aren't you being a
little pushy here?

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.360
What?

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:48.810
Not there!
Military personnel go here!

00:05:48.810 --> 00:05:50.950
I've heard about this colony,

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.450
but this colony is
quite strange, isn't it?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:54.320
Yes.

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:09.330
They're getting on the bus now.
Is this not going to work?

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.940
There's no point in capturing
them if they're not the crew.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.740
We're going to trade
them for a Gundam, right?

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:16.620
Which means it can't be
helped if we take a few extra.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:21.900
Oh! That woman! Looks a little
strong-willed, but close enough!

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.250
Bring me that woman!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.310
There's just something
about a strong-willed woman!

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.050
Do you read me?

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.310
Yes.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.120
What's that?

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:37.420
N-Nothing! Just some jewelry!
Hurry up and get on that bus!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.470
Not the bus to the right?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.930
What's wrong?! I can't see her!

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:43.120
You get on the bus on the left!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.350
I see.

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:46.720
- After you.
- Right.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.640
Delicious...

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.140
Forgive me, sir!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.650
It looked like she was about
to spot my hidden camera.

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:57.670
What's the big idea?!
Why are you splitting us up?!

00:06:57.670 --> 00:06:59.250
Let us choose which to ride in!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.220
- No!
- Everyone.

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:06.230
We're grateful that these
people have agreed to accept us.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.330
But your ways are strange to us.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:13.420
We'll happily comply if
you'd just explain yourselves.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:16.130
This is a peaceful colony.

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:19.400
We can't allow military
personnel to be seen here.

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.140
That's why you're being separated!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:24.040
- We understand.
- We're at fault here.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.240
Sarasa.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:29.280
- We must make amends for ourselves.
- Even more lovelies!

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:31.790
- There must be others! Show them!
- Sir!

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.650
What should we do, Roux?

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.920
Sarasa's right, Elle.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:37.920
Right! Bring them all here!

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:38.460
Hey!

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.930
And send the men somewhere else!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.410
Yes, sir.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:49.710
The man who runs this colony...
Stampa Halloi, was it?

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:50.790
Yes.

00:07:51.840 --> 00:07:54.790
He seems to be a man
of refined tastes.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.240
You!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.740
Aren't you one of the people
saved by the Argama?

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.300
You were put aboard
this one, as well?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.450
It... it's a strange
colony, isn't it?

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.150
You think so?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:08.620
Perhaps this too
is the will of the light.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.760
- Are you sure about this?
- What?

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.540
Just doing what
they say like this.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:14.730
All we can do is
let this play out.

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.730
You think Elle and
the others are okay?

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.230
Dunno.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.750
We're taking you
to a special residence!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.030
R-Right!

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:23.160
We appreciate the service!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.950
What's he doing?!

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:37.360
- What's going on?!
- Everyone okay?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:42.650
I-I think so.
What's that Petit Mobile Suit up to?!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:45.760
Everyone, out!
Follow our instructions!

00:08:45.760 --> 00:08:48.170
If you don't...!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.880
- What the hell?!
- What's going on?!

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:56.420
We are taking you hostage!
Now, get out!

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.570
Hostage?!

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:59.870
Mister, do something!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.860
Oh, for...
Great time to be unconscious!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:05.240
Are you gonna resist?!

00:09:05.240 --> 00:09:08.010
You think you're going
to get away with this?!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:08.890
Actually, yes!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.650
What?! Why, you...!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.550
Just hand over a Gundam!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:14.250
What?

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.100
Move!

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.980
You better do what we say!

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:22.680
- Cut it out!
- Judau!

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.500
Why, you...!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:31.690
Come back here!

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.020
Time to pay the piper, pal!

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:39.850
L-Lemme go!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:42.450
- You want to steal a Gundam?!
- Lemme go!

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:44.200
Did Stampa put you up to this?!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:44.880
No!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.750
I got this one under control!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:50.160
We just wanted
a mobile suit!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.150
We don't work for Stampa!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.230
And what will you do
if you get a mobile suit?

00:09:54.230 --> 00:09:55.830
Sell it for money.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.840
Sell it?

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.670
If we don't, we won't
be able to pay our taxes!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:02.830
Taxes? This is to pay taxes?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.390
We have no choice!

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:08.610
Even kids are sent to the
mines if they can't pay their taxes!

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:11.660
That's how this colony works!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:15.750
I'll bet all your women
were put on another bus.

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:21.300
Stampa takes all the women
that he likes for his harem!

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:25.270
What?
Where's this harem of his?!

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:28.730
Tell us more!
Is that true?!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.930
I'll tell you, but I can't
if you keep doing that!

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:43.140
Wow! Check out
that old junk heap!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:44.690
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:10:45.650 --> 00:10:47.450
Is it much further?

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:50.610
You're being welcomed.
Now come on!

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:53.940
- Rasara.
- Right.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.870
If he owns a mobile
suit like that, then...

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:01.330
What are you up to,
Stampa Halloi?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.230
Will Astonaige and
the others be okay?

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:13.260
They'll be fine. Alvin and Tara
are leading them along the back way.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.670
Shouldn't they
have just stayed here?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:18.590
No, they should get
back to the Nahel Argama.

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:23.250
Yeah, better that it's just us
getting kidnapped by Lunan here.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.750
Ooh, this is nice!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:28.690
Just to be clear, we're not
working for you guys!

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:32.760
We just want ol' Stampa
to get what's coming to him!

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:34.930
Gotcha. Dress!

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.260
I don't want to wear this getup!

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:38.760
Rasara's in danger!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.680
And it looks good on you, Iino.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:43.090
Don't look at me like that!

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:48.090
If we don't hurry, a Neo-Zeon
ship could find us and start a battle.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:48.840
Lunan...

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:53.010
Oh, no! We don't have the
money to get out of here!

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:56.380
That's why I said we'll do this
and get the money from Stampa!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.380
- Let's go!
- Lunan!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.680
Okay, time for us to go, too!

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:16.750
Why'd they stick us in
this nasty-ass room?!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.540
Oh, Argama...

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:22.310
Who'd have thought you held
such a collection of beauties?

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:28.260
Which means I might just charm them
into giving me control of their ship!

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:34.470
Perhaps it was the light
that led us to a place like this.

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.350
My sister wants
only to help you.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.190
How kind of her.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.640
And just how do
you intend to save me?

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:46.280
There is something
hidden in your heart.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:48.560
We shall bring it to the light.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:52.110
Mind your own business!
Stop it, please!

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.160
So long as you deceive yourself,

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:57.160
you will never be
able to see the light.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:01.410
I will not stay in the same room
with these strange people!

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:02.580
Take me to another.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:03.730
B-But...

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:05.600
Do as she says!

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:07.020
U-Understood.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.250
Thank you.

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:13.340
I'll save her for later.
But first, the young cuties!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:19.380
But with father and mother dead,
there's no place for the three of us!

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:20.910
Sister!

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:22.490
Don't cry!

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:25.120
You don't look like
you're related at all.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.870
Please, good gatekeeper, sir!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.010
Please let us work for Mr. Stampa!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.450
You're still just a kid.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.960
We'll do anything!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.400
And the oldest of you...

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.510
She's the ugliest thing I've ever seen!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:44.420
That's so cruel!
So cruel!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:48.190
Well, I'm sure a strong gal can
get work where no one can see you.

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:50.750
Hey! Lead them into the estate.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.150
Thanks, mister!

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:55.750
They're in.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.430
Our turn. This way!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:07.860
Judau. There's another one.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.720
That'll come in handy.

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:12.970
What?

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:18.030
Lot of mobile suits here, huh?

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:24.990
Forgive the wait.
His Excellency will see you now.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:27.140
Look, before that...

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:29.800
What kind of reception doesn't
even give us a cup of tea?!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:32.220
How dare you say that after being
invited to join Master Stampa's harem!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.170
His what?!

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:37.180
Welcome to my castle!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:42.470
Stampa Halloi welcomes you lovely
ladies from the bottom of his heart!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:45.430
And there he is.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.150
Just wait for our chance.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.390
Please leave this to my sister.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:54.060
I open my heart to you!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:57.750
No, your heart is closed.

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:02.810
The light will excite
a healthy heart.

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:06.120
A greedy and obstinate
heart will not see it at all.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:10.810
Showing such a man the light
is like lending them your hand.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.840
Come!
Open your heart and see!

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.750
Trust me. I'm looking!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:21.350
Your Excellency!
Are you all right?!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.870
Damn you, couldn't you knock?!

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:25.810
I didn't think
you'd be in here!

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:27.690
What do you want?!

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.140
Well, it's these girls...

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:34.190
What is this awful thing?!

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:37.880
They want to join your harem.
They have no home or family.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:39.890
You... Ju--

00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:43.190
Sarasa, come over here a sec!

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:46.010
And you let them in
without my permission?!

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.010
Yes, sir.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.660
For crying out loud!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:52.000
That girl and
that girl can stay.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.780
Throw out this ugly one!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:54.710
Yes, sir!

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:56.010
You can't!

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.510
Her voice is awful, too!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:02.850
Now that we've rid ourselves
of that ugly thing, let's continue.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.220
- What a getup...
- I think it suits me.

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:11.390
Don't cry.
This may be for the best.

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:14.700
You don't know
what goes on here.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.650
Don't be so sad about--

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.220
Nothing personal, pal.

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:25.300
Hang on, everyone!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.120
Isn't that the girl we just...?

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:36.230
What're you doing?!

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.180
They spotted me already?

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.320
Here we go!

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:44.720
How does this work?
A key?

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:50.640
Stop or I'll shoot!

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.140
Why, you...!

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.970
It's Judau.

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.340
- Hurry up!
- I'm doing it!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:04.120
Okay, that's got it!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.340
Move!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.430
What's he doing?!

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:07.990
Lunan!

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:10.680
Like I'm just going
to do what you say?!

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.550
Doesn't anyone
hear these gunshots?!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.740
The outside's an antique,
but the cockpit's state of the art!

00:17:18.740 --> 00:17:20.170
It's not just for
a collection, is it?

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.930
Mondo, the boat!
Get the boat ready!

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:28.810
Gotcha!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:34.940
I need beautiful women like you
to be the symbols of Tigerbaum!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:37.990
Is this what you
were talking about, Iino?

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:38.920
Looks like it.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.150
Wh-What's...?!

00:17:41.970 --> 00:17:44.070
My mobile suit!

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:48.330
Who's operating it?

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:50.190
This feeling...

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.020
Judau Ashta!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:59.130
Ow! Mobile-suit
piloting isn't that hard!

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.710
You...!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:05.090
A robbery?
Of all the impudent...!

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:07.400
M-Master Stampa!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.150
Here it comes!

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.180
Elle, where are you?!
Roux!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.980
Judau! Here!

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.020
That window!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.940
Judau!

00:18:17.940 --> 00:18:19.410
Get back!

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.420
Let's go!

00:18:26.350 --> 00:18:28.010
Come on, hurry!

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:30.570
We'll be helpless if
we get attacked here!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:33.230
All set, Judau!

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:40.080
There's a lot of enemies!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.380
Stay out of this!

00:18:57.140 --> 00:19:00.860
Look at this mobile suit!
It's an anachronism!

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:09.240
Since when can a
Z'gok move that fast?!

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:17.870
I can't tell how
powerful it is, but...!

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.090
It's me, Lunan!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.370
Not Beecha?

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:22.890
Where's Stampa?!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:27.170
We have to grab him and get money!
Judau, behind you!

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:32.090
Give it a rest!

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.490
Here it comes!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.150
Lunan! It's strong...

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:51.110
Lunan, run!
You're no match for this one!

00:19:51.110 --> 00:19:52.240
Understood!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.900
Aren't you gonna attack?

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.000
- Judau Ashta.
- That voice!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.330
Haman Karn.

00:20:07.090 --> 00:20:10.340
We meet again, Judau Ashta.

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:12.930
What are you doing here?

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.550
I wanted to have
another talk with you.

00:20:15.550 --> 00:20:17.850
So I came to see you.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:19.820
Follow me!

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:23.220
Do that and I will acknowledge
your powers as a Newtype.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.020
You won't have to
die a useless death.

00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:27.820
I'm not planning to!

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:30.230
You don't seem to understand.

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:31.800
I do.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.280
Enough to see that
everyone's getting caught...

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:36.030
in this war you
adults started!

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:38.200
Childish lines like that
won't work on me.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:41.120
What you adults want
is what's wrong!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:53.420
You... you...!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:57.820
That's right. You can't
kill a defenseless person.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:00.340
I know that you're
still just a little boy.

00:21:00.340 --> 00:21:02.060
WHAT?!

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:05.270
What?!

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:11.400
What's Haman doing here?

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:15.450
I nearly had him.
Stampa, you and your imbeciles...!

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.810
Our crew, kidnapped.
Your security, helpless to stop it.

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:25.350
I can't just "calm down"!

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.520
But, the immigration
conditions state...

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.800
I understand.
We won't leave here again.

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:33.190
Let us prepare to leave port!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.590
You really will?

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:36.320
You okay, Lunan?

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.680
Leave it to me!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:40.820
Why do you feel like
helping us out now?

00:21:40.820 --> 00:21:43.530
Because I learned
a lot from you guys.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:44.940
Learned what?

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:49.770
That Tigerbaum's getting caught up
in this war, and how bad Stampa is.

00:21:49.770 --> 00:21:53.380
Judau. Please be careful.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:55.380
Don't fall into the whirlpool
of this colony's evil.

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.090
Huh?

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:58.950
It's expanding, rapidly!

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.870
Because Haman's here?

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:03.500
Yes. Perhaps.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.840
But, Sister,
what's been protecting...

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:09.760
Judau and the others from
Haman's evil till now has been...

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.890
I'd like to think that
it's been our powers.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:17.630
However... as the evil deeds of
adults pile atop each other,

00:22:17.630 --> 00:22:21.660
they crush what's
beautiful and noble beneath.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:51.630
Even as we're ready to leave Stampa's
colony, Haman seems to be calling us.

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:56.300
We can't go. On top of that,
Stampa attacks us with mobile suits.

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:59.380
You shouldn't give knives to kids--
No, that's not it. Um...

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:01.890
Agh! Mondo,
don't do anything crazy!

00:24:01.890 --> 00:24:05.810
Our next enemy's coming!
This is no time to be crying!

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
RASARA'S LIFE

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:09.730
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Rasara's Life."

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:12.860
Sarasa's so calm, isn't she?
